{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：07:20 2026-10-22 HKT<br/>發佈時間：07:20 2026-10-22 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：07:20 2026-10-22 HKT</p><img alt=\"黎志偉攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/83706081fdb73d2ebaa3863d335f6056/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-21_at_23_20_46.jpeg\"/><p>將軍澳發生持刀傷人案。昨晚（21日）11時許，一名約30歲男子負傷自行前往將軍澳醫院求醫，醫護人員發現其頭部及手部有懷疑刀傷，遂通知警方。</p><p>警方經調查後，初步相信男子在駿日街、近一間航空發動機維修公司一帶遇襲。警方正跟進案件，追查涉案人士下落。</p><img alt=\"黎志偉攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5cbf0bd2eaa5b6770bc17a852e8b0d2e/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-21_at_23_20_45.jpeg\" title=\"黎志偉攝\"/><p>黎志偉攝</p>\n<p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T00:41:02.922188+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":210,"images":2,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T23:20:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T01:18:00.960389+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T00:37:42.962328+00:00","content_hash":"0f28c5dfb8eff2557eee9c6d11cba65fef98bd06317c0a3c67663772c4fc6eac","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}